    "citation": "Canadian Society for Exercise Physiology, Canadian Standardized Test of Fitness Operations Manual, 3rd ed., 1986; reproduced as the push-up norms in ACSM's Guidelines for Exercise Testing and Prescription, 10th ed., Table 4.9.",
