    "population": "General Canadian adults 20-69. Men perform the full push-up; women perform the modified knee push-up.",
    "provisional": true,
    "transcription_verified": false,
    "notes": "PROVISIONAL for one specific reason. The male cut-points are used as published and match this battery exactly. The published female norms are for the MODIFIED knee push-up, which this battery does not use, so female values here are the published numbers multiplied by 0.62 - a conversion factor from small published comparisons of knee versus full push-up capacity. That factor is the provisional part, and it makes push-ups the least trustworthy number on a woman's card. The 70-79 and 80-84 bands extrapolate past the source's 69-year ceiling."
  },
